{
  "description": "Mutations applied to the non-focus node of the shared minimal artifact. The Python validator, the JSON Schema and LineageCore.parseArtifact must all agree on every case. Setting \"id\" also rewrites the edge endpoint so only the ID itself differs; \"delete\" removes the field.",
